      ],
      "id": "0fa12c96-1b5e-499e-afe3-aab8ea76c35c",
      "name": "Loop Over Items"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const getFieldValue = (field) => {\n  if (!field) return null;\n  return field.value ?? field.fieldValue ?? field.field_value ?? null;\n};\n\nconst output = [];\n\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const contact = { ...item.json.contact };\n\n  const profileField = contact.customFields?.find(\n    f => f.id === 'fOhQq0LYtGa6bNka9SNh'\n  );\n\n  const companyField = contact.customFields?.find(\n    f => f.id === 'hPfsTj2cuY7fbUtcUSsm'\n  );\n\n  const industryField = contact.customFields?.find(\n    f => f.id === '49WkuHQOFDR2LTnJPMC7'\n  );\n\n  contact.profileUrl = getFieldValue(profileField);\n  contact.companyLinkedinUrl = getFieldValue(companyField);\n  contact.industry = getFieldValue(industryField);\n\n  output.push({\n    json: {\n      ...item.json,\n      contact\n    }\n  });\n}\n\nreturn output;"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        3952,
        3376
      ],
      "id": "afa66b55-9519-4a01-8c01-7ddce4c4b7d8",
      "name": "Url formatting - Apollo"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Generate a cold outreach email using the exact subject line and body provided below. Do not rewrite, summarize, or modify the wording. Only insert the recipient's first name where indicated.\n\nFirst Name: {{ $json.firstName }}\n\nSubject line:\nHonest question\n\nEmail body template:\n\n{{ $json.firstName }},\n\nHow many hours did you spend last week on work that isn’t tax or accounting?\n\nI ask CPA firm owners that a lot. The answer is usually some version of: client emails, document chasing, scheduling, and billing that slips.\n\nThat’s not a discipline problem. It’s a systems problem.\n\nI help small CPA firms cut that admin layer with an operating system: automated intake, document collection, follow-ups, email triage, and recurring billing — installed in ~3–4 weeks.\n\nOne Michigan CPA (40 years in practice) told me after: “I was exhausted… you gave me my life back.”\n\nIf you want to see where time is leaking in your specific firm, here’s the free 15-minute Practice Audit:\n\nLink’s there when you’re ready.\n\n— John\n",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=# HTML FORMATTING\n\n**Required:**\n- Wrap each paragraph in `<p>` tags\n- Use `<strong>` for emphasis (min 3 times per email)\n- Use `<ul><li>` only for 3+ items\n\n**Forbidden:**\n- No markdown\n- No CSS/inline styles\n- No `<html>`, `<body>`, or `<head>` tags\n- No escaped HTML entities\n- Return clean HTML only\n\n**Example:**\n```html\n<p>First paragraph with <strong>emphasis</strong> on key term.</p>\n<p>Second paragraph continues the story.</p>\n```\n\nReplace {{$json.firstName}} with the provided first name.\nReturn the output as JSON in this exact format with no extra text:\n\n{\n  \"name\": \"{{ $json.firstName }}\",\n  \"subject\": \"Honest question\",\n  \"emailBody\": \"full email body here\"\n}\n---"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        3888,
        4016
      ],
